@host = http://localhost:4004
@chat = {{host}}/service/Chat
@geral = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Login": "davi",
    "Password": "123456"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.AccessToken}}

### Conversas com nao lidas
GET {{chat}}/Conversations?$orderby=LastMessageAt desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mensagens do Geral com remetente
GET {{chat}}/Messages?$filter=Conversation_ID eq {{geral}}&$orderby=createdAt desc&$top=30&$expand=Sender
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pessoas (com IsOnline)
GET {{chat}}/People
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Membros do Geral
GET {{chat}}/Members?$filter=Conversation_ID eq {{geral}}&$expand=User
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enviar mensagem
POST {{chat}}/SendMessage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "{{geral}}",
    "Text": "Ola, resenha!"
}

### Marcar como lida
POST {{chat}}/MarkAsRead
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "{{geral}}"
}

### Meu perfil
GET {{chat}}/Me?$expand=Settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar perfil
PATCH {{chat}}/Me(a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "DisplayName": "Davi Castro",
    "About": "Trabalhando"
}

### Minhas configuracoes
PATCH {{chat}}/MySettings(User_ID=a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Theme": "Dark"
}

### Chave publica VAPID (null se o push nao estiver configurado no servidor)
GET {{chat}}/PushPublicKey()
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inscrever este navegador no Web Push (endpoint precisa ser https)
POST {{chat}}/SubscribePush
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Endpoint": "https://push.example.test/fake-endpoint",
    "P256dh": "BFakeP256dhKeyForLocalTestsOnly",
    "Auth": "fakeAuthForLocalTests",
    "UserAgent": "Chrome"
}

### Remover a inscricao deste navegador (so remove se for do usuario logado)
POST {{chat}}/UnsubscribePush
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Endpoint": "https://push.example.test/fake-endpoint"
}

### Lista de conversas com titulo, nao lidas e papel (Members, fixadas primeiro)
GET {{chat}}/Members?$filter=User_ID eq a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001 and IsArchived eq false&$orderby=IsPinned desc,Conversation/LastMessageAt desc&$expand=Conversation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Canais publicos (descobrir e entrar)
GET {{chat}}/PublicChannels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conversa privada com outro usuario (acha ou cria; idempotente)
POST {{chat}}/StartDirect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "User_ID": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"
}

### Criar grupo (Owner = quem chama; membros ignoram IDs invalidos e duplicados)
POST {{chat}}/CreateConversation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Kind": "Group",
    "Name": "Projeto Novo",
    "Description": "Grupo de exemplo",
    "MemberIds": ["a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"],
    "IsPublic": false,
    "OnlyAdminsCanPost": false
}

### Criar canal publico (IsPublic default true; so Owner/Admin publicam se OnlyAdminsCanPost)
POST {{chat}}/CreateConversation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Kind": "Channel",
    "Name": "Anuncios",
    "Description": "Avisos gerais",
    "MemberIds": [],
    "OnlyAdminsCanPost": true
}

### Editar nome e descricao (Owner/Admin; Geral so a descricao pelo Owner)
PATCH {{chat}}/Conversations(00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Projeto X",
    "Description": "Grupo de teste so com davi e ana"
}

### Adicionar membros (Owner/Admin, so grupo e canal)
POST {{chat}}/AddMembers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
    "UserIds": ["a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"]
}

### Remover membro (Owner remove qualquer um; Admin remove so Member)
POST {{chat}}/RemoveMember
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
    "User_ID": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"
}

### Promover ou rebaixar (so Owner): Role Admin ou Member
POST {{chat}}/SetMemberRole
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
    "User_ID": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
    "Role": "Admin"
}

### Sair da conversa (Owner sai: o dono e transferido ao Admin mais antigo, senao ao membro mais antigo)
POST {{chat}}/LeaveConversation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"
}

### Entrar num canal publico (idempotente)
POST {{chat}}/JoinChannel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005"
}

### Enviar push de teste para todas as inscricoes do usuario
POST {{chat}}/SendPushTest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Criar upload de imagem (Kind Image|Video|File; Width/Height/DurationSeconds opcionais, so video)
POST {{chat}}/CreateUpload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "{{geral}}",
    "Kind": "Image",
    "MimeType": "image/png",
    "FileName": "foto.png",
    "Size": 2048
}

### Enviar o conteudo do upload (stream; o servidor converte a imagem para webp; Size declarado deve bater)
PUT {{chat}}/Uploads(00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000)/Content
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: image/png

< ./foto.png

### Enviar miniatura de video (jpeg ou webp, ate 300 KB)
PUT {{chat}}/Uploads(00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000)/Thumbnail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./miniatura.jpg

### Enviar mensagem com o upload (legenda opcional; Text pode faltar quando ha Upload_ID)
POST {{chat}}/SendMessage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Conversation_ID": "{{geral}}",
    "Text": "Olha essa foto",
    "Upload_ID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Mensagens com o anexo expandido
GET {{chat}}/Messages?$filter=Conversation_ID eq {{geral}}&$expand=Attachment&$top=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Token de midia para <img src> (vem no login/refresh como MediaToken; expira em 24 h)
@mt = {{login.response.body.MediaToken}}

### Miniatura do anexo (sem Authorization: usa ?mt=)
GET {{chat}}/Attachments(00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000)/Thumbnail?mt={{mt}}

### Conteudo do anexo inline (imagem/video); com download=1 sai como attachment
GET {{chat}}/Attachments(00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000)/Content?mt={{mt}}&download=1

### Trocar a foto do proprio perfil (stream; saida webp 512x512; AvatarVersion += 1)
PUT {{chat}}/Me(a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)/Avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg

### Remover a foto do proprio perfil (AvatarVersion += 1)
DELETE {{chat}}/Me(a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)/Avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Foto de uma pessoa (v = AvatarVersion para cache; mt para <img src>)
GET {{chat}}/People(a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)/Avatar?v=1&mt={{mt}}

### Trocar a foto de grupo ou canal (Owner/Admin; nao vale para Direct; Geral so Owner)
PUT {{chat}}/Conversations(00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)/Avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: image/png

< ./grupo.png

### Remover a foto de grupo ou canal
DELETE {{chat}}/Conversations(00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)/Avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Foto de canal publico para quem nao e membro (so o stream Avatar)
GET {{chat}}/PublicChannels(00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005)/Avatar?v=1&mt={{mt}}
